==Finnish==

===Etymology===
A passive verb, derived from {{suffix|fi|syödä|alt1=syö|pua|alt2=pyä}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{hyphenation|fi|syö|py|ä}}
* Rhymes: [[yöpyä]]

===Verb===
{{fi-verb}}

# {{lb|fi|intransitive|+ illative}} To [[eat]] into, [[erode]] (''soil''), [[corrode]] (''metal'').

====Conjugation====
{{fi-conj-sanoa|syö|p|v|y|ä}}

====Derived terms====
* verbs: ''causative'' {{l|fi|syövyttää}}
* idioms: ''syöpyä'' + ''genitive'' + {{l|fi|mieli|mieleen}} = to [[be]] ([[indelible|indelibly]]) [[engrave]]d/[[inscribe]]d on sb's [[mind]]/[[memory]].